   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## starter 01 \u00b7 regions in 30 seconds\n\n**You need:** nothing (no models, no Blender).\n\n**Do:** Queue (Ctrl Enter). The sample facade becomes regions (every window, the door, cornices, pilasters,\nfloors) and the plan gives each region a prompt: the two previews show the regions and the plan.\n\n**Then try:** your own facade: replace node 1 with Load Image and set node 2 to *color_regions* (a flat-colour\nmatrix) or *mask_folder* (a folder of After Effects mask PNGs). Edit the rules in node 3: `[W_F*]` = all windows,\n`[M_Door]`, `[group:Windows]`, `denoise`, `strategy = keep`. **regions to svg / pdf / dxf** writes the regions as vectors (needs the package shapely).\n"
   ],
   "title": "read me"
  }
